{"candidate_identity":"d1221f2e518f0da923c4a9556019b6cbd229aa7be968f70a3c04abb41a7bc1bb","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7211f24c0ffde5e0db1da90247eb88f5a5501e5d5b9edf1c7b40a7a69b29cccc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa41108db6fd063219daf03ccbb7090033d98e8ab1a117e3b03103d4e89ba9e6","logical_entry_identity":"d60d9ee9062edb2eaec7e66bcdbb012f1d4fce546857b7ba60a7d6adbbc9d1cb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"horrifying","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"恐惧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be3532a6667b2e403bf2390582f98e3c8c4f2531665dd6e97d9b80d84c91d15f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa41df43df232e4226f34c2457f690b1611165e9a45eb5fa5d69bf36ed5913ba","logical_entry_identity":"5da68f7cb4d7bf1288890de09087575f399dde5ae876d2b30e7a18d0e5263722","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cold repulsion","source_tag":"damage type","target":"寒冷排斥"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e08cfcf9e948bca2aa2e00dbd6c59bc5867f1d0a8d2dfdf9765119c52297cb9d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa46653bd94a12b486edd6cf727eaefadeab65e7f8f5b5b11f65c577de026e33","logical_entry_identity":"5366df0f038fc2335df6b687d42384997e30b1a4f2d6406822823151d3994a64","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"woollen","source_tag":"entity short_name","target":"呢绒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4b89ddb504c8ede671ba33b130d0561836af5e0ede08f9a9642ac95bb6f2ba3a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa47d755452281f9aadf11e370ad642b8d9fe35f3d349ff4aefdd389ecc4b189","logical_entry_identity":"8a65b246742011e0867f6f88fb39ae96d3d587e49ac0fd514f6129b258e5048a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Peer into the future, detecting enemies, increasing defense by %d, and granting a %d%% chance to ignore critical hits.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"预知未来，感知敌人，并增加 %d 闪避与 %d%% 暴击摆脱率。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"854333b9f6091fe96cbf1f5e8cd1476e3ea8a638ea30898f70a0c01e3dc0e5ff","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa4843d8c370449525a02605641bb7eb02c6a582916dba752c2008923e14d2b3","logical_entry_identity":"541aebeb08358e12e3ab8b467bfebf4d5572ad7e15d80a97a074ad00285f6418","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"We must be on guard. The Council of Elders is desperate to find us, to hunt us down and suppress us. But we will not be suppressed. We have our rights! Their scouts try to track us down, and their spies try to infiltrate our numbers. They cannot accept any others having power, or any voice but their own being heard.\n\nWe have split away from our people, and we follow our own path now. We are outcasts. They call us renegades, anarchists; they think of us as nothing but vermin to be crushed underfoot. But we will not endure their cruel suppression. Our voice will be heard across the world and they shall recognise a new race of power - the mighty Rhaloren!\n\n-- The Inquisitor\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们必须时刻戒备。长老会正不顾一切地寻找我们，企图追捕、镇压我们。但我们绝不会屈服。我们有自己的权利！他们的斥候试图追踪我们，间谍则企图混入我们的队伍。他们容不得别人拥有力量，也容不得任何不同于他们的声音被世人听见。\n\n我们已经脱离永恒精灵，走上了自己的道路。我们是被放逐者。他们骂我们是叛徒、无政府之徒，只把我们当成该踩死的害虫。但我们绝不会忍受他们残酷的镇压。我们的声音将传遍世界，他们终将承认一个强大的新种族——伟大的罗兰精灵！\n\n——审判者\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5deabae555ab41e07385992c4edc73f2736ca0001f1e6de8f9bb37ee446fd404","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa531fc798903a0345577fbdb021d146be63d48bffc8035b98fa418edeff5cb8","logical_entry_identity":"6ba273b79ffe38e14226a89dc4f778c89c55102747fc75bd171d92651eb4a4cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#\nBarbrim the Cursed\n#{normal}#92 - 119#{italic}#\nBetrayed by those he trusted\n#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#\n被诅咒者巴巴瑞\n#{normal}#92 - 119#{italic}#\n被他所信任的人背叛\n#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"05da2e2d7acdc505caa4b6e5abf60e9a4d28267a850bc618238333f805888fae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa53dbcb5b0bae21cd1bd05560089d12d26a0e2da4f369a2c26ecfc7f08b54f8","logical_entry_identity":"04cf16dd826ecc9c57606da4e35c906816b88f94a79921224d230c2f05840ca7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The people you saw are likely the volunteers of Zemekkys' early experiments regarding the farportals.\nHe is a mage who resides here in the Sunwall, eccentric but skilled, who believes that creation of a new farportal to Maj'Eyal is possible.\nAside from a few early attempts with questionable results, he hasn't had much luck. Still, it's gladdening to hear that the volunteers for his experiments live, regardless of their location. We are all still under the same Sun, after all.\n\nActually... maybe it would benefit you if you meet Zemekkys. He would surely be intrigued by that Orb of Many Ways you possess. He lives in a small house just to the north.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你看到的那些人很可能是泽梅基斯关于远行传送门实验的志愿者。\n他是居住在太阳堡垒的一个法师，脾气古怪但是很有能力，他坚信可以创造一个远行传送门达到马基·埃亚尔。\n除了他早期的一些尝试获得了一点可疑的结论外，他并不算走运。不过还是很高兴听到他的实验对象还活着，无论他们身在何方。毕竟我们都生活在同一片阳光下。\n\n事实上……也许去见见泽梅基斯对你有好处。他一定会对你手上的多元水晶球感兴趣。他就住在北边的小屋里。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e3a6407eb4492381c294ded8a4d0dbbda15cdd7ba2acfd97e1d565b224d67138","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa5429b14b8e34b94df3cb97ceb84b1cf041161edc8a6ddefb05432b65e41f6d","logical_entry_identity":"ba545703de375afabfacf2a3fe66ed078e8dbc1690776130e86597e0b3422963","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Detach from item","source_tag":"_t","target":"从物品上解除附加"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d2be644368b569ba40411d21f549149e1bd3d0fceb11cf5c7fb80bbb9cc51cf4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa5f04cff558ef021f820ef08b8558d0a94342fff3ff1598d5690422f66d730a","logical_entry_identity":"5972ca134b2cdae5f52b80a216dd209d0ac287da901c925f9a7b94cec7d61601","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"She looks tired and wounded. She is so similar to you and yet completely different. Weird.","source_tag":"_t","target":"她看起来疲惫又受伤。她跟你是如此的相像，但完全不一样。好奇怪。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"75ba9322c839b04f0e96cea102ab04973bdbac4ec3defb35cbb6ec58f