。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6c4d8fb073cb005d2a759bc4fcb0f402e8638813a6e0a67d95dc08a384d861e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa80300271b3dcd9e74fe9873dc61ed66eefe6c0bf819f4a1caa4722f8f142d4","logical_entry_identity":"1f399677884e27b245be5b613048838a236d9cb9a61885603777a2837f77d6ff","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Elemental Surge: Nature","source_tag":"_t","target":"元素狂潮：自然"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b526965eded52e870e0c69cd9201d815ed2867d5da9e4ae7a4ed6c02b84b1952","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa80b0a260c554c3f6dbcf2a4ddb79fb9d9853df4e69a4bf6378a1e11e8555c2","logical_entry_identity":"5d73ad8191d31c864d71e7cde465f91c7786096df89d0aa413352970fa8cc54b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This intricate blade is impractically long and almost as wide as your body, yet contrary to its size and apparent girth it is not only light, but threatens to escape your grasp and fly away. You will need to be really strong to keep it grounded. Or really big.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这把长得不可思议的剑几乎和人一样宽，与其巨大尺寸格格不入的是，它的重量极轻，而且似乎总想要从你的手中飞走一样。要么足够强壮，要么足够高大，你才能握紧这剑，防止其飞走。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0ce3fa12c2eab20a48dafa597e7c99b924dbb388ab0642c96c74fb304f6be1d7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa81f96c111c6687a630ebdbb40299ef6f1b4792f1ab538e220581959ff29c45","logical_entry_identity":"89d0dd44f557974b82b9aa83e3b4a6c0bc2ff64d6d56d646c91bd6ce1781882b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"setup a psionic shield, reducing all damage taken by %d for 5 turns","source_tag":"_t","target":"制造灵能护盾，5回合内受到的所有伤害减少%d"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ab54528a2c9d3957fdbd11c7e2431526604ec95603cb8fb0cc6fabe47dee0c78","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"aa84f7fc4d91ccb0fdf90b27c8fc119f86be5c495086f8fc6c5fe8d6193b0350","logical_entry_identity":"8c6a932b08f789c5c0ae1f2a7bcb6234fb600f8b0899603a7a153713f138c993","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Increases critical hit chance by %d%%.","so